Reinforce your armor with countless tiny void stars, increasing armor by [19, 24, 29, 32, 35 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100)].

Each time your void stars are fully depleted, you gain a shield absorbing the next [170, 212, 245, 272, 297 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100)] damage taken within 4 turns. This shield cannot trigger again until your void stars are fully restored.
